From: WG2600HP isolated backport staging
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] net: dsa: QCA8K 8021Q switch-side backport for 6.12.112

Reference: 2026-09-11 upstream 6.18 prototype.
Base: Linux 6.12.112 + OpenWrt 711-01/02/03 + 712.
NOT production-ready: dual-CPU/FDB/VLAN/ECM requires verification.
